      "title": "Cold Storage",
      "description": "Shot over two weeks road-tripping through Northern Hokkaido, this snowboard film follows a tight crew of riders chasing powder, convenience store snacks, and the thrill of riding remote zones. With just a van and no set plan, we explored quiet corners where the turns were deep and the ramen bowls were deeper. It’s the kind of trip that leaves your legs sore, your camera full, and booking a return before your boots are even dry.",
